OL,3,GNEWSAAsian women 'never heard' on      
OL,4,Ahealth, says director                  
OL,6,FA community centre director in Luton   
OL,7,Fsaid a "hidden generation" of Asian    
OL,8,Fwomen had "voices that were never      
OL,9,Fheard" when it came to their wellbeing.
OL,11,FThe Let Women Speak report commissioned
OL,12,Fby the borough council in Luton, where 
OL,13,Fthe onset of poor female health happens
OL,14,Ffive years earlier than average, also  
OL,15,Ffound over 70% of women aged 45-64 had 
OL,16,Fan at-risk body mass index.            
OL,18,FFiroza Abdool-Sathar, director of the  
OL,19,FCentre for Youth and Community         
OL,20,FDevelopment (CYCD), said: "Some of our 
OL,21,Fladies maybe 20 years ago, their voices
OL,22,Fdid not matter.                        
